classDiagram
    class Report {
        +path string
        +inquiries list
        +gaps list
        +decisionForm DecisionForm
        +inlineSvgFigures list
    }

    class Inquiry {
        +id string
        +confidence string
        +evidence list
        +externalLinks list
    }

    class Option {
        +direction string
        +badge string
        +linkedFromRow bool
    }

    class Gap {
        +description string
    }

    class DecisionForm {
        +decisionsText string
        +copyButton bool
    }

    class Validator {
        <<check_options_report.py>>
        +checkAnchors() bool
        +checkFigures() bool
        +checkRowToDirectionLinks() bool
        +checkConfidenceValues() bool
        +checkExternalLinks() bool
        +checkCopyButton() bool
        +main() int
    }

    Report "1" *-- "many" Inquiry : holds
    Report "1" *-- "many" Gap : lists
    Report "1" *-- "1" DecisionForm : ends with
    Inquiry "1" o-- "many" Option : proposes
    DecisionForm ..> Inquiry : cites by ID
    Validator ..> Report : reads HTML and exits non-zero

    note for Report "Ten anchors fix the structure.<br>The validator checks each one is present."
    note for Option "Proposes only. It never records a decision."
    note for DecisionForm "Pasted into design mode,<br>whose stage 4 decides"
